        "date": "2026-11-12T12:41:14Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): a Plasma cutting machine mode, so the plasma table and its operations can be reached from the ribbon\n\nThe machine mode switch had three rows (Milling, Turning, Mill-turning),\nso the Tormach 1300PL and its Plasma section could not be reached from\nthe ribbon. The table gains a Plasma cutting row mounting the built-in\nTormach 1300PL through the same undoable LoadBuiltinMachine. Each row's\ntext now names the section it adds, read from the registry. A structural\ntest fails when a machine kind with a shipped machine has no mode row, or\na row names a machine that is missing or of another kind.\n\nFixes #1195\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
