      "message": "fix(ui): the machine door keeps its plain caption; mode tip and menu follow the mode table\n\nAddress review of #1195 (PR #1200): the door shows the plain caption,\nthe door tip lists every mode from the table, the mode table moved to\ncrates/ui/src/machine_modes.rs, and the menu is as wide as its longest row.\n\nFixes #1195\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
